      "text": "After forcing Obelisk Force to retreat, Yuya and his friends met Celina."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Zuzu!"
    },
    {
      "char": "celina",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I'm not Zuzu."
    },
    {
      "char": "dennismacfield",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I looked for Zuzu, but all I could find was this one here."
    },
    {
      "char": "sora",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Sora… Don't tell me your friends took her away!"
    },
    {
      "char": "sora",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "char": "sora",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Sora!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Sora teleported away before they could question him further."
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "You've all dueled well. This battle royal was really a test. A test to see who can cut it as a Lancer."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Lancer?!"
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Defending our world is not good enough – we have to take the battle to the Fusion Dimension. And you and your fellow Lancers will lead that charge!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "And Zuzu – what about her? What if they got to Zuzu too?"
    },
    {
      "char": "dennismacfield",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "celina",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "If anyone's responsible for her fate, it's me. My name is Celina. I'm from the Fusion Dimension!"
    },
    {
      "char": "gogenzaka",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Say what!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "shingo",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "If you're from the Fusion Dimension, then you're one of our enemies!"
    },
    {
      "char": "shingo",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Celina is no spy. In fact, a squad of Fusion Warriors was sent to hunt her down."
    },
    {
      "char": "celina",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "It's true. These warriors are members of Obelisk Force. They probably thought she was me."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Then Zuzu's…"
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "If you don't want to lose any more friends like Zuzu, then it's best you join my Lancers and take the fight to them."
    },
    {
      "char": "dennismacfield",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Then seven super duelists are ready for your orders, Sir!"
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "We're nine."
    },
    {
      "char": "yuya",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "!"
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Riley will be joining us."
    },
    {
      "char": "celina",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dennismacfield",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "shayobsidian",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I don't like it one bit. Attacking the Fusion Dimension is tough enough without having to keep our eyes on that kid."
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Then it's a good thing we won't be going there."
    },
    {
      "char": "shayobsidian",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "We're not?"
    },
    {
      "char": "declanakaba",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "If we go to the Synchro Dimension first, we can recruit duelists and form an alliance!"
    }
  ]
